WEBVTT

00:15:28.031 --> 00:15:31.959
I want our children
to become young men and women

00:15:31.983 --> 00:15:36.660
who can continue nourishing
the trees that will grow

00:15:36.684 --> 00:15:39.655
from the seeds that we are planting today.

00:15:40.507 --> 00:15:42.568
Now can someone tell me

00:15:42.592 --> 00:15:47.746
why we should not dare imagine
that future in Sierra Leone?

00:15:50.921 --> 00:15:52.139
Thank you.

00:15:52.163 --> 00:15:59.087
(Applause)